      "text": "# Tide Workshop membership and access Synthetic demonstration policy. This is not a real workshop or safety standard. Effective 1 October 2026. Applies to adult members at the Riverside site. ## Access The Riverside workshop opens Monday to Friday from 09:00 to 20:00. It opens Saturday from 10:00 to 16:00. The workshop is closed on Sunday. Members must scan their own membership card when entering and leaving. Lending a membership card to another person is not permitted. The minimum membership age is 18 years. ## Induction Every member must complete the general induction before entering a work area. General induction lasts 45 minutes and is booked through the member portal. Completing general induction does not authorize use of the laser cutter. Laser cutter access requires a separate laser induction and a current equipment endorsement. An endorsement expires 12 months after the induction date. A member with an expired endorsement must attend a refresher before booking that equipment. ## Membership and support Standard membership costs INR 900 per month. Membership fees do not include equipment booking fees or materials. Members can",
